护，建议更换为受支持的 IP-PBX 设备。如无法更换，在防火墙上添加规则阻止外部对管理端口的 GET 请求，并限制请求长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0336.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1727","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5298","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0964.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0964.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0964","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0964.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0964.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0964.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2000/CVE-2000-0964.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0964.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0964.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0964.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1800.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1777","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1777.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0961","title":"Netscape Messaging Server IMAP 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape Messaging Server 4.15 Patch 2 的 IMAP 服务组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器的 IMAP 端口发送特制的超长 LIST 命令触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而可在服务器上以服务进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响