e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0954.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1708","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0952","title":"NetBSD Global global.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"NetBSD 系统上运行的 Global 3.55 及更早版本中的 global.cgi CGI 程序存在命令注入漏洞。由于程序未对用户输入中的 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）进行有效过滤，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 CGI 接口发送特制 HTTP 请求，在服务器上以 Web 服务进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞可导致目标系统被完全控制，包括数据窃取、恶意软件植入等严重后果，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0952"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:50Z","remediation":"由于该软件版本过于陈旧且已停止维护，建议立即停止使用 Global 3.55 及更早版本，迁移至现代安全的替代方案。若必须临时运行，请在防火墙或 Web 服务器配置中禁用/拦截对 global.cgi 路径的外部访问，以防止远程命令执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6486","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5424","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ca27d016571e65b8b794044c0722f4842d8c02cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0952.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0952.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0952","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0952.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0952.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0952.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2000/CVE-2000-0952.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/0xxx/CVE-200