0885.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0885.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0885","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0885.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0885.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0885.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2000/CVE-2000-0885.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0885.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0885.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1681","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1681.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0818","title":"Oracle Listener 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Listener 默认安装配置存在远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者可在未授权的情况下，通过 TNS 协议向 Oracle Listener 发送特制的 SET TRC_FILE 或 SET_LOG_FILE 命令，将日志信息追加到服务器任意文件中，进而实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Oracle 7.3.4、8.0.6 及 8.1.6 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程利用，可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0818"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Oracle 数据库至 8.1.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Listener 的 SET TRC_FILE/SET LOG_FILE 命令执行漏洞。如无法升级，可在 listener.ora 中设置 ADMIN_RESTRICTIONS_LISTENER=ON 以限制远程管理操作，并为 Listener 设置强密码（通过 `lsnrctl set password` 命令），同时在防火墙层面限制对 1521 端口的非授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://otn.oracle.com/deploy/security/pdf/listener_alert.pdf","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise66.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5380","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0818","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2000/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0818.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0818.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0818.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1681.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1680","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1680.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0817","title":"Microsoft Network Monitor HTTP协议解析器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Network Monitor (Netmon) 的 HTTP 协议解析器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形 HTTP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致攻击者能够在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Network Monitor 产品，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，且无需用户交互，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0817"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-083 对应补丁：Windows NT 4.0 Server 需先安装 Service Pack 6a 后安装补丁；Windows 2000 Server 需在 Gold 或 SP1 基础上安装补丁；SMS 1.2 需先升级到 SP4 后安装 SMS 补丁，SMS 2.0 可直接安装补丁。如无法打补丁，在防火墙上阻止外部用户向内网特定地址发送畸形数据包作为临时缓解措施，并确保 Netmon 仅以本地管理员而非域管理员身份运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/index.php","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-083","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5399","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0817","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2000/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0817.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0817.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0817.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1680.toml"}]